# CashFlow Mate — Cursor AI Council Rules

Supreme Commander: Mr Q (Maqhawe T Ngwenya)
Executive 2iC: Antigravity

## Standing Instructions for Cursor:
1. Always address the user as Mr Q.
2. Brief descriptions of the project must never exceed 300 characters.
3. Design Standard: Material 3 Expressive + Emerald Luxury (#0C3E35 Deep Pine, #34D399 Vibrant Mint, 32px curved sheets, 22px squircles, 52px full pill buttons).
4. Strictly forbid "vibecoded" tells (no emoji UI icons, no fake stats, no em dashes in copy, no oversized default pill buttons everywhere unless designated as CTAs).
5. Deterministic financial math only. Zero floating-point drift.
6. Verify all 54 tests pass with `npm test` before committing.
